{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10106380","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10106380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1010638001:1":{"text":"토끼 귀, 왜 그래? 배에 문제라도 생긴 거야?","source_cn":"兔耳朵，怎么了？船有问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EEF4DAD9D2624AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010638002:1":{"text":"아니에요. 괜찮아요. 저랑 같이 왔을 땐 부두에서 평온하게 자고 있던걸요. 그냥 움직이는 걸 안 좋아하는 것뿐이에요!","source_cn":"没有，它好好的，和我来时一样安稳地在码头睡着呢，就是不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA534D1DFBD60F840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010638003:1":{"text":"땅거미 숲은 최근 꽤나 혼란스럽다고 들었는데, 꼭 가야겠수?","source_cn":"薄暮丛林最近乱的很，你们非去不可？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x378A91D7A6DFFAC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010638004:1":{"text":"그걸 해결하러 가는 거예요!","source_cn":"我们就是去解决乱子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2628D41120FDCF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010638005:1":{"text":"저... 좋소. 어찌 되었거나, 와일더스 연맹의 사람이니 별 문제 없겠지.","source_cn":"你……好吧。毕竟是绿裔联盟的人，也许不会有问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C6C28C5B5BB1780","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010638006:1":{"text":"하지만 난 당신들을 데려다만 주는 거지, 다른 일은 상관 없는 거요!","source_cn":"不过说好，我只负责送你们过去，其他的事我就不管了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE474A4CDFA72993F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010638007:1":{"text":"물론이죠, 그럼요.","source_cn":"当然、当然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x026E79DD6E6F6B15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010638008:1":{"text":"그럼 늘 하던대로 하지.","source_cn":"那就还是老样子，老规矩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8F32198E20064E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010638009:1":{"text":"윽... 죄송하지만 정리 좀 부탁드려요. 이분들은 제가 모시고 온 손님들인데 저처럼 화물칸을 비집고 들어가게 할 순 없잖아요!","source_cn":"呃——麻烦你多收拾收拾，这几位是我请的客人，不能让他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB98447481CC7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1010638009":{"text":"윽... 죄송하지만 정리 좀 부탁드려요. 이분들은 제가 모시고 온 손님들인데 저처럼 화물칸을 비집고 들어가게 할 순 없잖아요!","source_cn":"呃——麻烦你多收拾收拾，这几位是我请的客人，不能让他们和我一样挤货舱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB98447481CC7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010638010:1":{"text":"여행을 다니느라 가진 돈이 별로 없어서... 저는 그럭저럭 괜찮지만, 여러분을 불편하게 할 수는 없죠!","source_cn":"我旅游四方，身上没有多少钱……凑合凑合没关系，但是不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B0EE79DE113082","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010638012:1":{"text":"그럼 우리, 출발하죠.","source_cn":"那我们，出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C5A9D63F00B291A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010638013:1":{"text":"땅거미 숲, 내가 돌아왔어...!","source_cn":"薄暮丛林，我回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x615873A89005D220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"네가 화물칸을 비집고 다녔을 줄이야...","source_cn":"你竟然是挤货舱来的……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3FC431F4F18356","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 화물칸을 비집고 다녔을 줄이야...","female":"네가 화물칸을 비집고 다녔을 줄이야...","variant_male_record_index":"58890","variant_female_record_index":"58891","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1010638011:1":{"text":"맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"交给我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5670E34A0F1CF24E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맡겨주세요!","female":"맡겨주세요!","variant_male_record_index":"97875","variant_female_record_index":"97876","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"그럼, 객실 비용은 네가 낼 거야?","source_cn":"那，客舱的钱，你付？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4AED22FB80EFD3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럼, 객실 비용은 네가 낼 거야?","female":"그럼, 객실 비용은 네가 낼 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"58892","variant_female_record_index":"58893","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:船夫费舍尔":{"text":"사공 피셔","source":"船夫费舍尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":3}}